# Issue 2: Filebeat and Dashboard Not Installed

## Problem

After installation, the Wazuh Manager and Indexer were running, but the Dashboard and Filebeat services were missing.

Checking the services returned:

```
Unit wazuh-dashboard.service could not be found. Below is the Screenshot of the terminal where both Wazuh Indexer and Manager were running perfectly while Dashboard and Filebeat wasnt installed
```
<img width="1536" height="1152" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d2d6d60-6e88-45a2-9c8c-4559f3e0fd5b" />
---

## Cause

The installation had failed during the Filebeat deployment because of the APT lock.

As a result, only part of the Wazuh stack was installed.

---

## Resolution

After resolving the package manager issue, I reran the installer.

The remaining components were installed successfully, and all Wazuh services became operational.

